{"3419910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Light Up The Town", "steam_appid": 3419910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Up The Town</strong> is a cozy, creative game about spreading  cheer in a wintery town. Play as <strong>Bean</strong>, a young ferret tasked with putting up lights and  decorations around Bellflower, Colorado in time for the Winter Festival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/ae2c29392d23af8b31911d6d3874a2b3.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/ae2c29392d23af8b31911d6d3874a2b3.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/ae2c29392d23af8b31911d6d3874a2b3.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click anywhere to throw string lights and Christmas/holiday decorations, and light up 18+ handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0a4a4275883a087d2d3ed2709415973d.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0a4a4275883a087d2d3ed2709415973d.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0a4a4275883a087d2d3ed2709415973d.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate any way you want to, customizing size and rotation of decorations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0b8dd0951aed8b9337e7bff86f943710.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0b8dd0951aed8b9337e7bff86f943710.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0b8dd0951aed8b9337e7bff86f943710.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins around town to unlock even more lights and decorations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/7f6cd1611d18e5bd93d2f4428ac6486e.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/7f6cd1611d18e5bd93d2f4428ac6486e.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/7f6cd1611d18e5bd93d2f4428ac6486e.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bellflower's annual Winter Festival is coming up, but the town is still dark! Local electrician Chuck is out of commission, so it's up to his precocious daughter <strong>Bean</strong> to put up lights and decorations around town before the festival.  And with a blizzard on the way, the holidays hang in the balance. What does it take to make your community a better place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Up The Town</strong> is a cozy, creative game about spreading  cheer in a wintery town. Play as <strong>Bean</strong>, a young ferret tasked with putting up lights and  decorations around Bellflower, Colorado in time for the Winter Festival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/ae2c29392d23af8b31911d6d3874a2b3.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/ae2c29392d23af8b31911d6d3874a2b3.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/ae2c29392d23af8b31911d6d3874a2b3.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click anywhere to throw string lights and Christmas/holiday decorations, and light up 18+ handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0a4a4275883a087d2d3ed2709415973d.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0a4a4275883a087d2d3ed2709415973d.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0a4a4275883a087d2d3ed2709415973d.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate any way you want to, customizing size and rotation of decorations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0b8dd0951aed8b9337e7bff86f943710.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0b8dd0951aed8b9337e7bff86f943710.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0b8dd0951aed8b9337e7bff86f943710.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins around town to unlock even more lights and decorations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/7f6cd1611d18e5bd93d2f4428ac6486e.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/7f6cd1611d18e5bd93d2f4428ac6486e.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/7f6cd1611d18e5bd93d2f4428ac6486e.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bellflower's annual Winter Festival is coming up, but the town is still dark! Local electrician Chuck is out of commission, so it's up to his precocious daughter <strong>Bean</strong> to put up lights and decorations around town before the festival.  And with a blizzard on the way, the holidays hang in the balance. What does it take to make your community a better place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Light Up The Town is a cozy, creative dec